Suggests: steam
Description: Live coaching for Dota 2: rules, voice, AI reviews and statistics
 Gourdian reads Valve's Game State Integration feed while you play Dota 2 and
 coaches on it: it speaks tips about rune timings, a missing TP scroll, low HP,
 unspent gold and skill points, farm pace and item timings, shows the same lines
 in a view you can pin over the game, sets targets from your own match history,
 records every match, and asks an AI coach for advice and match reviews.
 .
 The feed describes your own hero only. Gourdian never reads game memory,
 injects into Dota, or sees enemy information.
